{"name":"Bubble Bujo","title":"Bubble Bujo","revision":220109,"url":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/Bubble_Bujo","retrieved":"2026-09-06","license":"CC BY-SA","licenseUrl":"https://www.fandom.com/licensing","language":"en","blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Bubble Bujo is all about decorating things for your favorite people. It is most commonly used for K-Pop singers by K-Pop stans. Bubble Bujo uses a lot of bright, vibrant colors; similar to Kidcore, but with some slightly different styles. Some popularly used items are stickers, ribbons, cartoon bears, cakes, sparkles, hearts, and smiley faces. Letter stickers are also used. The Korean brand called \"THENCE\" is very popular in Bubble Bujo. While binders/diaries are the most popular, some other popular things to decorate are CDs and photocards, which are included in K-Pop albums and collected by fans. There are smaller binders specifically for these photocards. Keychains are often attached to 6-ring binders, and vary from small, thin keychains with cutesy pictures to beaded straps to resin shaker keychains."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Visuals"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Elements of Bubble Bujo:"},{"kind":"list","text":"Beads"},{"kind":"list","text":"Bubbly, thick fonts Cooper Sugary Pancake"},{"kind":"list","text":"Ribbons and bows"},{"kind":"list","text":"Stickers"},{"kind":"list","text":"Glittery things Sparkles Sequins Glitter glue"},{"kind":"list","text":"Cartoon bears"},{"kind":"list","text":"Hearts"},{"kind":"list","text":"Stars"},{"kind":"list","text":"Butterflies"},{"kind":"list","text":"Smiley faces"},{"kind":"list","text":"Fruits or \"sweet\" food Strawberries Cherries Cake"},{"kind":"list","text":"Flowers"},{"kind":"list","text":"Plaid"},{"kind":"list","text":"Gingham"},{"kind":"list","text":"Sanrio characters"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Fashion"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Although fashion is not a key element of this aesthetic, here are some popular things used to style Bubble Bujo outfits:"},{"kind":"list","text":"Bright pastels"},{"kind":"list","text":"Plaid"},{"kind":"list","text":"Gingham"},{"kind":"list","text":"Cartoon imagery/characters"},{"kind":"list","text":"Graphic tees"},{"kind":"list","text":"Celebrity logos"},{"kind":"list","text":"Sweaters"},{"kind":"list","text":"Cute Socks"},{"kind":"list","text":"Oversized hoodies and jackets"},{"kind":"list","text":"Denim Loose straight leg/mom jeans Overalls Loose shorts"},{"kind":"list","text":"Big sneakers"},{"kind":"list","text":"Pleated mini skirts"},{"kind":"list","text":"Converse High-tops"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Music"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Genres"},{"kind":"list","text":"K-Pop"},{"kind":"list","text":"Pop"},{"kind":"list","text":"Dance"},{"kind":"list","text":"KRnB"},{"kind":"list","text":"Hyperpop"},{"kind":"list","text":"Electronic"},{"kind":"list","text":"Hip-hop"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Artists"},{"kind":"list","text":"NewJeans"},{"kind":"list","text":"TWICE"},{"kind":"list","text":"NCT"},{"kind":"list","text":"Red Velvet"},{"kind":"list","text":"EXO"},{"kind":"list","text":"Seventeen"},{"kind":"list","text":"BTS"},{"kind":"list","text":"Oh My Girl"},{"kind":"list","text":"The Boyz"},{"kind":"list","text":"Blackpink"},{"kind":"list","text":"SHINee"},{"kind":"list","text":"ITZY"},{"kind":"list","text":"SUNMI"},{"kind":"list","text":"CHUNG HA"},{"kind":"list","text":"GWSN"},{"kind":"list","text":"SUMIN"},{"kind":"list","text":"DEAN"},{"kind":"list","text":"LOONA"},{"kind":"list","text":"AESPA"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Resources"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Youtube Channels"},{"kind":"list","text":"justinebujo"},{"kind":"list","text":"verbl.rendezvous"},{"kind":"list","text":"beanbujo"},{"kind":"list","text":"Mani Land"}],"contentStatus":"full-source","images":[{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/c/c8/Zero_di4ry_on_ig_discovered_by_KT_%E2%99%A1_on_We_Heart_It.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20210420114659","caption":"Zero di4ry on ig disc